      "title": "tools: Don't use max as the name of a variable",
      "message": "tools: Don't use max as the name of a variable\n\nIt's confusing enough to use max, the name of a built-in function,\nas a variable name, but it's even worse to do so and then introduce\nattempting to use the built-in function. Rename it similar to what\nbb993cb45ee9f22d650edbd9b21059e4b2b7bb2f did with \"min\", also a\ncouple places that were missed there.\n",
